    {"type":"feature","component":"Configuración > Consignas","item":"Implement Punto -> Protocolo de Consignas -> Consigna -> Alcance -> Reglas/Evidencias."},
    {"type":"governance","component":"Consignment protocols","item":"Only one Consignment Protocol may be VIGENTE per Punto; published content is immutable and edits create a draft version copy."},
