    {"type":"evidence","component":"Consignas","item":"Support standard-image assets and future VISINT comparison, plus optional expected ATS/GPS location and execution GPS rule."},
    {"type":"migration","component":"Flyway V17","item":"Evolve canonical consignment table; add consignment_protocol, consignment_post_scope and consignment_evidence. No parallel consignment model."}
